<title>SOUTH KOREA: Dlr to stay above 890 won--Bank of Korea official.</title>
<headline>Dlr to stay above 890 won--Bank of Korea official.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The dollar will stay above the current 890 won level, if the dollar/yen rate does not fall further, a senior Bank of Korea official said on Friday.</p>
<p>The dollar stood at 891.00 won in morning trading in South Korea's interbank forex market, while the U.S. currency was being traded at 123 yen in world markets.</p>
</text>
